action_text:
1.) That the Board finds cause pursuant to pursuant to section 445.007, Florida Statues to remove all current board members of CareerSource Polk Board of Directors, such cause to include, without limitation, neglect of duty, gross mismanagement and lack of performance and;
2.) Direct staff to provide board members notice of this Board's findings and give individual board members of the CareerSource Polk Board of Directors the opportunity to respond why cause did not exist to be removed and request to be reinstated, such request shall be submitted on or prior to October 19, 2026; and
3.) For the Board to consider the request at a future board meeting to be determined.

